2026-07-27T06:43:54.4168110Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4168642Z i /tmp/Rtmp5Fx53b/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4169020Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4169698Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4170396Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4170982Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4171838Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4172481Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T06:43:54.4399902Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
